  <dashboards>
    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Dashboard Instructions'>
      <repository-location id='DashboardInstructions' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/QCLSAddaProduct-StoreManagementPlugin-LocalShopsReport-Updated' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
      <style>
        <style-rule element='dash-text'>
          <format attr='vertical-align' id='dash-text_6' value='top' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='800' maxwidth='1229' minheight='800' minwidth='1229' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98000' id='5' type-v2='empty' w='1362' x='97987' y='1000'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='98000' id='6' type-v2='text' w='97336' x='651' y='1000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='20' underline='true'>DASHBOARD INSTRUCTIONS</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ef4f4e' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11' underline='true'>SUMMARY</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ef4f4e' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11'>- </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='11'>This dashboard shows the first time a product was added by any vendor using the Store Management Plugin in the Vendor Portal, along with its current details as per the catalog and PIM.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ef4f4e' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11' underline='true'>DOWNLOAD DATA</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ef4f4e' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11'>-</run>
              <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='11'>You can download the data as a csv file by going through the below process - </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='11'>1. Filter for data that is required</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='11'>2. Click on download button on the top right of the dashboard ( 2nd button to the left of share button)</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='11'>3. From the options, click on Data</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='11'>4. You will see a preview of the data and a download button on the top right</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='11'>5. Click on the download button and the download should start!</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ef4f4e' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11' underline='true'>NOTES </run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ef4f4e' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11'>-</run>
              <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11'>Æ </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='11'>- If a vendor adds a product, deletes it and later adds the product back again, only the first date in which the vendor added the product will be displayed. Capturing of deleted products which are added again is currently WIP. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Light' fontsize='11'>- The data before March 21st had issues due to a bug. Hence only the products added after on and after March 22nd are reported here.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
