            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='8' italic='true'>*Update on June 13th - The summary scorecards has been separated from the &apos;High Level Impact - Table View&apos; because of some orders and GMV getting double counted in the overall numbers. A new data source has been used to tackle this for the scorecards view and a new view has been created.</run>
