              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='8' italic='true'>*The reported values here might be underestimated. There are cases in which the skuID/product information is missing(NULL) in the orders data. Hence, certain orders which contain some of the plugin added products might not be considered. Summary of the issue in the glossary</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='8' italic='true'>*Update on June 13th - The summary scorecards has been separated from the &apos;High Level Impact - Table View&apos; because of some orders and GMV getting double counted in the overall numbers.. A new data source has been used to tackle this for the scorecards view and a new view has been created. Please refer to &quot;High Level Impact - Summary Scorecards&quot;</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
