    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Update Notes'>
      <repository-location id='UpdateNotes' path='/t/GlobalStandardReporting/workbooks/QCLSAddaProduct-StoreManagementPlugin-LocalShopsReport-Updated' revision='' site='GlobalStandardReporting' />
      <style>
        <style-rule element='dash-text'>
          <format attr='vertical-align' id='dash-text_6' value='top' />
        </style-rule>
      </style>
      <size maxheight='800' maxwidth='1229' minheight='800' minwidth='1229' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='4' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='98000' id='5' type-v2='empty' w='1362' x='97987' y='1000'>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone forceUpdate='true' h='98000' id='6' type-v2='text' w='97336' x='651' y='1000'>
            <formatted-text>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='20' underline='true'>UPDATE NOTES</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ef4f4e' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11' underline='true'>2023-06-13</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'>1.The summary scorecards has been separated from the &apos;High Level Impact - Table View&apos; because of some orders and GMV getting double counted in the overall numbers.. A new data source has been used to tackle this for the scorecards view and a new view has been created. Please refer to &quot;High Level Impact - Summary Scorecards&quot;</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ef4f4e' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11' underline='true'>2023-06-02</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'>1. Added 3 new filters to &quot;Item Level View&quot; - Category Level One, Category Level Two, Category Level Three.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ef4f4e' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11' underline='true'>2023-05-22</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'>1. Moved Metrics table in &quot;High Level Impact - Table View&quot; from bottom to top.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ef4f4e' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11' underline='true'>2023-05-12</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'>1. Included New View - &quot;High Level Impact - Table View&quot;. This provides the impact in terms of orders, GMV, GBV for all the products added via the store management plugin</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'>2. Updated Values Glossary to include details of the new added view</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ef4f4e' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11' underline='true'>2023-04-24</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'>1. Included Master Product Code and Product Name Local Catalog in &apos;Item level view by Vendor&apos;.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'>2. Added Vertical Type filter in all views</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
              <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ef4f4e' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11' underline='true'>2023-04-21</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'>1. Changed Date format to dd-MMM-YYYY eg. &apos;14-Apr-23&apos;.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'>2. Now shows data till CURRENT_DATE - 2 DAYS. (Unless there&apos;s an issue in the data refresh jobs).</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'>3. Increased vertical height of &apos;Item Level View&apos; to 1500 px.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'>4. Added Category English as a filter to the &apos;Item Level View&apos; tab.</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'>5. Changed name of Georgraphy Parameter to Chart Level Parameter</run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'>6. In the &apos;High Level view&apos; - Removed the 100% stacked bar charts and included the % of total values in the tooltips in the Normal stacked bar charts. </run>
              <run>Æ&#10;</run>
              <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'>7. Added new tab &apos;Update Notes&apos; to keep &apos;tab&apos; of all changes/updates.</run>
            </formatted-text>
            <zone-style>
              <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
              <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
              <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
              <format attr='margin' value='4' />
            </zone-style>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <size maxheight='700' minheight='700' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
          <zones>
            <zone h='100000' id='336' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
              <zone h='98000' id='335' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98698' x='651' y='1000'>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='98000' id='6' type-v2='text' w='97336' x='651' y='1000'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#555555' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='20' underline='true'>UPDATE NOTES</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ef4f4e' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11' underline='true'>2023-06-13</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'>1.The summary scorecards has been separated from the &apos;High Level Impact - Table View&apos; because of some orders and GMV getting double counted in the overall numbers.. A new data source has been used to tackle this for the scorecards view and a new view has been created. Please refer to &quot;High Level Impact - Summary Scorecards&quot;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ef4f4e' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11' underline='true'>2023-06-02</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'>1. Added 3 new filters to &quot;Item Level View&quot; - Category Level One, Category Level Two, Category Level Three.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ef4f4e' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11' underline='true'>2023-05-22</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'>1. Moved Metrics table in &quot;High Level Impact - Table View&quot; from bottom to top.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ef4f4e' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11' underline='true'>2023-05-12</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'>1. Included New View - &quot;High Level Impact - Table View&quot;. This provides the impact in terms of orders, GMV, GBV for all the products added via the store management plugin</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'>2. Updated Values Glossary to include details of the new added view</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ef4f4e' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11' underline='true'>2023-04-24</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'>1. Included Master Product Code and Product Name Local Catalog in &apos;Item level view by Vendor&apos;.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'>2. Added Vertical Type filter in all views</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#ef4f4e' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='11' underline='true'>2023-04-21</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'>1. Changed Date format to dd-MMM-YYYY eg. &apos;14-Apr-23&apos;.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'>2. Now shows data till CURRENT_DATE - 2 DAYS. (Unless there&apos;s an issue in the data refresh jobs).</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'>3. Increased vertical height of &apos;Item Level View&apos; to 1500 px.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'>4. Added Category English as a filter to the &apos;Item Level View&apos; tab.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'>5. Changed name of Georgraphy Parameter to Chart Level Parameter</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'>6. In the &apos;High Level view&apos; - Removed the 100% stacked bar charts and included the % of total values in the tooltips in the Normal stacked bar charts. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='10'>7. Added new tab &apos;Update Notes&apos; to keep &apos;tab&apos; of all changes/updates.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
      <simple-id uuid='{6A0E3C48-00C8-405E-97DE-0D098B8E1EC4}' />
    </dashboard>
